SinoFlow HSK 1 Vocabulary Companion List:
1. 你好 (nǐ hǎo) - Hello
2. 谢谢 (xièxie) - Thank you
3. 再见 (zàijiàn) - Goodbye
4. 汉语 (Hànyǔ) - Chinese language
5. 学生 (xuéshēng) - Student
6. 老师 (lǎoshī) - Teacher
7. 谢谢大家 (xièxie dàjiā) - Thank you everyone
